From: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: rtw88: serialize raw debugfs register writes

Raw register writes must share the driver's register and firmware mutex.
Otherwise a debugfs writer can race ordinary power, calibration and reserved
page operations that already hold the mutex. Keep this native writer fix
independent of the removed TX gate snapshot and its eligibility state.

Not submitted upstream.

Signed-off-by: Bogdan Mircea <mirceapetrebogdan@gmail.com>
---
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/debug.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/realtek/rtw88/debug.c
@@ -405,6 +405,10 @@
 	if (num !=  3)
 		return -EINVAL;
 
+	ret = mutex_lock_interruptible(&rtwdev->mutex);
+	if (ret)
+		return ret;
+
 	switch (len) {
 	case 1:
 		rtw_dbg(rtwdev, RTW_DBG_DEBUGFS,
@@ -427,6 +431,7 @@
 		break;
 	}
 
+	mutex_unlock(&rtwdev->mutex);
 	return count;
 }
 
